ARRAY INSERT - the manual's example
  2,1,3= 1 2,2,3= 2 2,3,3= 3 2,4,3= 4
  and nothing else was written: 1,1,3= 0 2,1,2= 0

ARRAY SLICE - the manual's example
  a(2,*,3) = 213 223 233 243

a size mismatch is MMBasic's own error
  MM.ERRNO = 16  Size mismatch between slice and target array

COLOUR MAP's palette is 16 entries, counted the same way
  codes = 0 4 8 12
  pal   = 0F0F10 0F0F14 0F0F18 0F0F1C

and a palette of the wrong length is refused
  MM.ERRNO = 16  Array size not 16 elements
